{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/354f0b2ef370c1d085934fc626bc2916.avif?t=1769126553\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SoundBoard</strong> is a simple and fun app for anyone who wants to spice up voice calls, streams, and gaming sessions. Trigger sound effects with a single click, all neatly organized in a practical and highly customizable panel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The <strong>SoundBoard</strong> library is <strong>100% community-driven</strong>: like the sounds you love, discover new creations, or upload your own clips to contribute. You can also <strong>fully customize your home screen</strong> with exclusive categories, set hotkeys for any situation, and make the experience completely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With an intuitive design and a strong focus on ease of use, SoundBoard guarantees pure fun with zero hassle \u2014 whether you're streaming, chatting with friends, or in the middle of an intense match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Turn any moment into something special with <strong>SoundBoard</strong> \u2014 your personalized sound hub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With love,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc9c The SoundBoard Team</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">- <strong>MAKE SOUNDBOARD YOUR OWN</strong> -</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/19aa4139cd1b9db6a7c17478c375a684.poster.avif?t=1769126553\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/19aa4139cd1b9db6a7c17478c375a684.webm?t=1769126553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>SoundBoard</i></strong> offers a wide variety of themes so you can make the app truly yours. Each theme completely changes the look and feel, with styles to suit every taste. Just pick the one that matches your vibe and enjoy it your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- A HUGE LIBRARY -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/f32367ed0c4a24305a9711454fea9d1a.poster.avif?t=1769126553\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/f32367ed0c4a24305a9711454fea9d1a.webm?t=1769126553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>SoundBoard</i></strong> features an ever-growing library of community-uploaded sounds. Browse, discover fresh clips, and always find the perfect sound for the moment \u2014 all neatly organized and ready to use however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- SUPER EASY TO USE -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/9da4020589b2defd8fa29d6733514b2d.poster.avif?t=1769126553\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/9da4020589b2defd8fa29d6733514b2d.webm?t=1769126553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Adding sounds to your favorites in <strong><i>SoundBoard</i></strong> is quick and effortless. Just open the library, tap the heart on the sound you love, and it instantly appears in your personal list \u2014 ready to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- ORGANIZE IT YOUR WAY -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/eee96010758b109b57459a086690fcae.poster.avif?t=1769126553\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/eee96010758b109b57459a086690fcae.webm?t=1769126553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Organizing your favorite sounds in <strong><i>SoundBoard</i></strong> is fast and intuitive. Rename clips, create categories, and assign hotkeys in just a few clicks \u2014 everything perfectly arranged and always within reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- CUSTOMIZE YOUR PROFILE -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/7769f2ee2ac5d6becdbc24a56065a79d.poster.avif?t=1769126553\" width=1170 height=630 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/7769f2ee2ac5d6becdbc24a56065a79d.webm?t=1769126553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>SoundBoard</i></strong> lets you personalize your profile exactly how you want. Choose a theme, write your bio, and sync everything with your Steam avatar and background.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914510?t=1769126553","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/078d2a211f6eff5932f3319d1913ce84ef1be8c3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769126553","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/207b5046d2992d8b5e41ea642d8f68a3a938b1dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769126553","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/207b5046d2992d8b5e41ea642d8f68a3a938b1dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769126553","categories":[{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914510/extras/354f0b2ef370c1d085934fc626bc2916.avif?t=1769126553\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SoundBoard</strong> is a simple and fun app for anyone who wants to spice up voice calls, streams, and gaming sessions. Trigger sound effects with a single click, all neatly organized in a practical and highly customizable panel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The <strong>SoundBoard</strong> library is <strong>100% community-driven</strong>: like the sounds you love, discover new creations, or upload your own clips to contribute. You can also <strong>fully customize your home screen</strong> with exclusive categories, set ho